---
import trustedAccessDesktopDiagram from '../../../assets/backgrounds/security-two-layers-trusted-access-desktop.png'
import trustedAccessMobileDiagram from '../../../assets/backgrounds/security-two-layers-trusted-access-mobile.png'

const altText =
    'Diagram showing two layers of trusted access in Knodia: first, mutual trust between Knodes through authentication; second, controlled access to protected data through authentication, authorisation and an access token used by a data consumer to reach a data producer.'
---

<section
    aria-labelledby="security-trusted-access-title"
    class="bg-neutral-white"
>
    <div
        class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-(--header-shell-max) flex-col gap-8 px-(--header-mobile-padding-x) py-10 md:px-(--home-hero-inline-padding-md) xl:gap-12 xl:px-(--header-inline-padding) xl:py-32"
    >
        <div
            class="flex w-full flex-col gap-6 xl:flex-row xl:items-start xl:justify-between"
        >
            <div class="flex max-w-lg flex-col gap-8">
                <h2
                    class="font-heading text-home-support-title-sm leading-home-support-title-sm font-medium text-neutral-graphite xl:text-heading-lg xl:leading-heading-lg xl:font-normal"
                    id="security-trusted-access-title"
                >
                    Two layers of trusted access
                </h2>

                <span
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="h-1 w-16 rounded-full bg-primary-violet xl:w-24"
                ></span>
            </div>

            <p
                class="max-w-155 font-body text-intro-sm leading-intro-sm font-normal text-neutral-medium-gray xl:text-intro-lg xl:leading-intro-lg"
            >
                Knodia combines authentication and authorization layers: trust
                between Knodes + token-based access, so data is available only
                to the right actors, under the right conditions.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div
            class="w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-primary-light-violet/60 bg-neutral-white shadow-(--shadow-home-guidance-card)"
        >
            <img
                alt={altText}
                class="hidden h-auto w-full xl:block"
                decoding="async"
                height={trustedAccessDesktopDiagram.height}
                loading="lazy"
                src={trustedAccessDesktopDiagram.src}
                width={trustedAccessDesktopDiagram.width}
            />
            <img
                alt={altText}
                class="h-auto w-full xl:hidden"
                decoding="async"
                height={trustedAccessMobileDiagram.height}
                loading="lazy"
                src={trustedAccessMobileDiagram.src}
                width={trustedAccessMobileDiagram.width}
            />
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
